  "prefLabel": "Ac 102.12 Licensee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 102.12 “Licensee” means “licensee” as defined by RSA 309-B:3, IX, namely, “the holder of a license as defined in RSA 309-B:3, VIII” and includes each CPA and PA.\n\nSource. #10053, eff 1-1-12 (from Ac 101.11); renumbered by #13995 (formerly Ac 102.11)",
